<title>FRANCE: Suez, Lyonnaise mull linkup-paper.</title>
<headline>Suez, Lyonnaise mull linkup-paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie de Suez and Lyonnaise des Eaux are once again considering a possible linkup, Le Figaro newspaper said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Considered several times and regularly postponed, the last time in June 1995, this operation is once again under review,&quot; Le Figaro said, citing sources close to the affair.</p>
<p>Suez already owns 15 percent of Lyonnaise, a utilities and water company.</p>
<p>According to Le Figaro, Suez and Lyonnaise have already given bankers a mandate to study the conditions of a future linkup.</p>
</text>
